**`src/lib.rs`** — added `filter_by_tag`:
```rust
pub fn filter_by_tag<'a>(notes: &'a [Note], tag: &str) -> Vec<&'a Note> {
    notes.iter().filter(|n| n.tags.iter().any(|t| t == tag)).collect()
}
```
Exact-match on each note's `tags` vector, preserves original order.

**`src/main.rs`** — wired `--tag <TAG>` into the `list` command:
- Scans `args` for `"--tag"`, extracts the following argument as the tag value
- If present, calls `notekeep::filter_by_tag(&notes, tag)`
- If absent, lists all notes (no filter)

